  note right of Opened
    Open starts the window
    Development: one sample here
    Research: three, before lease
  end note
  note right of Leased
    Reuse replaces the wait
    never a sample
    INV ReusedRecordSameBoot
    INV ReusedRecordWithinBound
    INV ReusedRecordSameSwapouts
  end note
  note right of Qualified
    INV SecondSampleUnderLease
    INV WindowRespected
    INV ChainUnbroken
  end note
  note right of Settled
    INV NoStartFromChangedTree
    trees rechecked under lease
  end note
  note right of BootAdmitted
    INV BootBaselineIsLastSample
  end note
  note right of Refused
    INV RefusalIsClean
    no VM, lease returned
  end note
